      "date": "2026-06-17",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "notes": "12-item RFQ short form. EN via mapping to the 54 (orig #s 2,12,14,18,26,28,34,36,38,42,44,47); KO from UCL Korean RFQ (12). Cert/uncert split per the Korean RFQ-12 scoring note. CC BY via PLoS — now in openscales/."
    },
